cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Code Review Arena, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Code Review Arena"
abstract: >-
  An execution-backed benchmark harness for AI code-review agents. It applies each
  reviewer's suggested patch in an isolated workspace, runs the required tests and
  validators, and scores detection separately from validated repair. It also ships
  CRA-Integrity, a track that asks whether a reviewer can tell a genuinely correct
  green pull request from one whose validation evidence was weakened.
type: software
